WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:06.010
- What's the art in
the art of programming?

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:10.190
Why, why's there, of the
few words in the title,

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.570
why is art one of them?

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.870
- Yeah, well, that's what I
wrote my Turing lecture about,

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.087
and so when people talk about art,

00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:23.033
I mean, what the word means is,

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.590
something that's not in nature.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.043
So, when you have artificial intelligence,

00:00:30.043 --> 00:00:34.340
the art comes from the same root,

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:39.340
saying this is something that
was created by human beings,

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.260
and then it's gotten further meaning

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.950
often of fine art, which
adds this beauty to this mix,

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:50.220
and so then we have things
that are artistically done

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:53.330
and this means not only done by humans

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.360
but also done in a way that's elegant and

00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:01.223
brings joy and, and has,

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:07.184
I guess, Tolstoy versus Dostoyevsky.

00:01:07.184 --> 00:01:10.920
- (laughs) Right.
- Going, but anyway,

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:15.270
it's that part that says
that it's done well,

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:19.180
as well as not only different from nature.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:24.180
In general then, art is

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.780
what human beings are
specifically good at,

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:29.530
and when they say artificial intelligence,

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.510
well, they're trying
to mimic human beings.

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:36.270
- But there's an element
of fine art and beauty,

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:37.710
you are one cool--
- That's what I,

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.070
that's what I try to also say that,

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:44.193
you can write a program
and make a work of art.

